1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:07,384
Mediabase deserves a plain-language translation, because it is the least glamorous and most serious number in the story.

2
00:00:07,384 --> 00:00:13,608
It counts actual radio spins — airplay logged from monitored stations across the United States.

3
00:00:13,608 --> 00:00:18,054
No streaming bundles, no fan purchasing power, no algorithm.

4
00:00:18,054 --> 00:00:22,976
Real programmers, playing a Korean-language title track in daytime rotation.

5
00:00:22,976 --> 00:00:32,396
For a genre that spent two decades being told its ceiling was the internet, charting on US radio in year three is the kind of line that ends arguments.

